  width: 2rem;
  height: 2rem;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 0.375rem;
  background: transparent;
  color: ${args.theme.var.color.text};
  cursor: pointer;

  &:hover {
    background: ${args.theme.var.color.background_light_200};
  }
}`;'''
        displayOrder: 2
        componentName: Html
        props:
          '''return {
  as: "button",
  type: "button",
  "aria-label": "Close",
  onClick: () => args.contextData.props?.onClose?.()
};'''
      }
    }
